Subject: dt-bindings for SM7250 and OnePlus avicii

Combined diff of the following commits (base v7.3-rc7):

  - dt-bindings: arm: qcom,ids: Add SoC ID for SM7250
  - dt-bindings: clock: Add SM7250 global clock controller
  - dt-bindings: clock: qcom,rpmhcc: Document RPMHCC compatible for SM7250
  - dt-bindings: power: qcom,rpmhpd: Document RPMh power domain for SM7250
  - dt-bindings: firmware: qcom,scm: Document SM7250 SCM
  - dt-bindings: interrupt-controller: qcom,pdc: Document SM7250 PDC
  - dt-bindings: cpufreq: qcom-hw: Document SM7250 cpufreq hardware
  - pinctrl: qcom: add SM7250 TLMM driver
  - phy: qcom-qmp-ufs: add SM7250 support
  - scsi: ufs: qcom: support device reset via TLMM pinctrl states
  - dt-bindings: pinctrl: qcom,sm7250-tlmm: fix tile addresses in example
  - arm64: dts: qcom: sm7250: add TSENS and thermal zones with cpufreq cooling
  - clk: qcom: Add SM7250 display clock controller
  - drm/msm/dpu: Add SM7250 (DPU 6.1.0) catalog, mdss and UBWC data
  - drm/panel: Add Samsung AMS644VK04 DSC command mode panel driver
  - remoteproc/soc/mailbox: add SM7250 MPSS PAS, pd-mapper and IPCC compatibles
  - power: supply: Add Qualcomm PM7250B charger status and charge inhibit driver
  - clk: qcom: add SM7250 graphics clock controller driver
  - drm/msm/adreno: add Adreno 620 (0x06020000) catalog entry
  - arm64: dts: qcom: sm7250: add GPU, GMU, GPU clock controller and GPU SMMU
  - Input: add Goodix GT9886 touchscreen driver
  - dt-bindings: remoteproc: qcom,sm6350-pas: Add SM7250 ADSP
  - ASoC: dt-bindings: Add NXP/Goodix TFA9874 amplifier
  - dt-bindings: use a public contact address for the new SM7250 bindings

